<div class="textCon">
<div class="block-title noto600"><p class="">대학원 입학 / Graduate School Admission</p></div>
<div class="contents" data-delay="0.1"><div class="content block-content">
        <h1 class="page-title" style="text-align:left;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.1;font-size:28px;margin:12.5px 0px;color:#006979;text-transform:capitalize;border-bottom:3px solid #006979;padding-bottom:15px;">
        </h1><div><br></div>
    </div>


<ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;line-height:1.8;"><span style="font-size:18.6667px;"><b>대학원 과정 Graduateschool Programs</b></span><br><span style="font-size:16px;">• 연구 역량 함양 Developing research competency</span>&nbsp;<br><span style="font-size:12pt;">• 유연한 교육과정 Flexible curriculum<br></span><span style="font-size:12pt;">•&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:16px;">다양한 졸업제도 Graduation system in various ways</span>&nbsp;</li></ul><div style="line-height:0.5;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><br></span></div>

<ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;line-height:1.8;"><span style="font-size:18.6667px;"><b>지원가능 학과 Application capacity</b></span><br><span style="font-size:12pt;">:</span><span style="font-size:16px;">4개 대학원 및 36개 전공 4 Graduate Schools and 36 majors</span></li></ul><ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;font-size:12pt;"><span style="font-size:12pt;">붙임파일[모집요강] 참고</span><span style="font-size:12pt;">&nbsp;</span></li></ul><div><br></div><div><ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;"><span style="font-size:18.6667px;"><b>대학원 홈페이지 Graduateschool website</b></span><br><span style="font-size:12pt;">:</span><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);"><span style="font-size:16px;"><u><a href="https://bufs.ac.kr/bbs/board.php?bo_table=graduate" rel="nofollow"><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);"><u>https://bufs.ac.kr/bbs/board.php?bo_table=graduate</u></span></a></u></span></span></li></ul><div><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);"><span style="font-size:16px;"><br></span></span></div><span style="font-size:16px;">•&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size:18.6667px;">Application Guideline (모집요강)</b><br><ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;font-size:12pt;"><a href="https://oiaglobal.bufs.ac.kr/graduate_kr/1" rel="nofollow"><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);">정원외 대학원&nbsp;모집요강 국문 바로가기</span></a></li><li style="list-style:inherit;font-size:12pt;"><a href="https://oiaglobal.bufs.ac.kr/graduate_en/1" rel="nofollow"><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);">정원외 대학원 모집요강 영문 바로가기</span></a></li><li style="list-style:inherit;font-size:12pt;"><a href="https://oiaglobal.bufs.ac.kr/graduate_ch/1" rel="nofollow"><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);">정원외 대학원 모집요강 중문 바로가기</span></a></li><li style="list-style:inherit;font-size:12pt;"><a href="https://oiaglobal.bufs.ac.kr/graduate_vi" rel="nofollow"><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);">정원외 대학원 모집요강 베트남어 바로가기</span></a></li></ul><div><span style="font-size:18.6667px;"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div><div><ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;"><span style="font-size:18.6667px;"><b>온라인 지원 링크 Online Application Link</b></span><br><span style="font-size:12pt;">:</span><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);"><span style="font-size:16px;"><u><a href="https://m.bufs.ac.kr/Degree_Default.aspx" rel="nofollow"><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);"><u>https://m.bufs.ac.kr/Graduate_Default.aspx</u></span></a></u></span></span></li></ul><div><span style="color:rgb(0,117,200);"><span style="font-size:16px;">&nbsp;</span></span></div></div><div><ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;"><span style="font-size:18.6667px;"><b>모집시기 Admission Period</b></span><br></li></ul><div><b></b><b>
</b><p><b><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);"><span style="font-size:12pt;"></span></span></b></p><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px solid #cccccc;border-left:0;border-bottom:0;" class="__se_tbl"><tbody>
<tr><td style="border-width:0px 0px 1px 1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);width:839px;height:24px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><p style="text-align:center;"><br></p><p style="text-align:center;">&nbsp;<b><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);"><span style="font-size:12pt;">1학기 1</span></span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:12pt;">ST Semester</span></b></p><p style="text-align:center;"><b><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:12pt;"><br></span></b></p></td>
<td style="border-width:0px 0px 1px 1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);width:839px;height:24px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><p style="text-align:center;">&nbsp;<b style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);"><span style="font-size:12pt;">2학기 2</span></span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:12pt;">nd Semester</span></b></p></td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="border-width:0px 0px 1px 1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);width:839px;height:21px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><p style="text-align:center;"><br></p><p style="text-align:center;">&nbsp;<b style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:11pt;font-weight:normal;">10~12월&nbsp;</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:11pt;font-weight:normal;">Sep~Dec</span></b></p><p style="text-align:center;"><b style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:11pt;font-weight:normal;"><br></span></b></p></td>
<td style="border-width:0px 0px 1px 1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);width:839px;height:21px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><p style="text-align:center;" align="center"><br></p><p style="text-align:center;" align="center">&nbsp;<b style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,102);"><span style="font-size:14.6667px;font-weight:400;">4~6월&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:14.6667px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(102,102,102);">Apr~Jun</span></b></p><p style="text-align:center;" align="center"><b style="text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:14.6667px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(102,102,102);"><br></span></b></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table><p><br></p><p><br></p><ul style="margin:0px 0px 12.5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;list-style-type:square;"><li style="list-style:inherit;line-height:1.8;"><span style="font-size:18.6667px;"><b>지원 절차 Application Period</b></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ul></div></div>
<div style="text-align:center;" align="center">
        <div class="block block-system block-system-main-block no-title" style="background:rgb(255,255,255);margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;border:none;">
            <div class="content block-content">
                
                    
                    <div class="node__content clearfix">
